                              |GKBSTUDY OF CORPSES
|YK0================================================================

|YKB'He who knows others is learned. He who knows himself is wise.'
|WKO - |RKBMaster Lao-Tzu|YK0

A Monk studies the corpses of their fallen foes to improve and
develop their understanding of a creatures anatomy. A Monk 
receives a small boon from the gods for honouring their foes
in this manner.

|GKBThis is a Master of the West Wind power.

